ory":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Winona County came in under 90% of normal in 35 of 75 years for August to September and for November to December. On the middle of the grids, January to February 2025 came in at 31% of normal, and May to June 2026 sits at 74% so far. Grid 28652 had its driest year in 1958 at 58%, while grid 28953 had its driest in 1976 at 61%.</p>"}
